  23:06:16): coral 2026-11-13 00:06, fire 2026-11-14 04:47, pm25 04:47, defo 14:35, ndvi 2026-11-15 19:11 (the done
  records' `finished` times and the files' modification times agree). The official treeroute importances equal A's
  main-run values (largest difference 2.8e-17) and differ from the B1 run's (up to 0.013 in I on fire, 0.20 on pm25,
  0.046 on ndvi). On defo the B1 run equals the main run exactly, so it could not change a number either.
- A's code: `a10_items1_8.py` and `a05_global_rule.py` open only the pieces of `per_lead.json`'s `models` (a10 stops
  if `treeroute_B1` is among them); its record of opened files (`V\A\work\opened_items_<p>.json`) names no B1 file.
